{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c410c3073936421311a12fe76f6135728c9d6726171b8f1c088c3c02d1d6d4d9", "ja": "（次の公演のセンターは、まつりに決めた。\nこの時間、まつりは控え室にいるはずだけど……）", "zh": "（下次公演的Center确定是茉莉了。\n现在这个时间，茉莉应该在准备室里吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "bc5d27ea48445db614865d0bef990c49584eda58e42c3ed535df525b023ffcee", "ja": "ま、マラソン？　ロコ、そういうのはちょっと……。\nでも、アートのためなら……ブツブツ……。", "zh": "Ma、Marathon？ROCO对这种活动不太……\n不过如果是为了Art……（自言自语）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d83a13910e3127dd861b293f1581c59f7172902f4fc355ab8d29ca933dab87f7", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n……ロコ、どうしたんだ？　難しい顔して。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n……ROCO，你怎么愁眉苦脸的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "cddf342bcab9d4385b9fb3d5d82b0e04c2a43682dd839e24c64894c3921f24c9", "ja": "{$P$}！　ロコは今、アートのために\nフィジカルの限界に挑戦するか、迷ってたんです……。", "zh": "{$P$}！ROCO现在正在烦恼\n要不要为了Art，挑战Physical的极限……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1004_p", "source_sha256": "899b2edeba1adfccf07e987fb100a5957271ec319c3a04534bd062d08eda00c6", "ja": "相変わらず、ロコの悩みは一筋縄では\nいかなそうだな……。ところで、まつり。", "zh": "ROCO的烦恼还是老样子，\n没那么容易解决呢……话说回来，茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "764f6548c75f04ecf583d205cb0319e7b7f0b11e0cb759e19b2b39397096942b", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さん、\n姫に何かご用なのです？", "zh": "Hi Ho──！{$P$}先生，\n有什么事找公主的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b1782c6a3b4b85b2130ac2f94f7f89d5518d91608c042c6a4cd3bdc17b48452b", "ja": "ああ。次の公演は、まつりにセンターを\n務めてもらおうと思うんだけど……どうだ？", "zh": "嗯，下次的公演，我想让茉莉来担任Center……\n你意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "4a80caf6a0d359d2dc0de063b422a79a08d234c47b6e6377c3b2cde8e5354b78", "ja": "ほ……。", "zh": "哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b25577c75a6c930405155d1d64e778770784750704da1541977000c567c034b9", "ja": "ほ？", "zh": "哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "e14c8a420f65ec2d5d94cc67c62e26b1095773afc0d926cdcadea5f5d90d4214", "ja": "マツリ？", "zh": "茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "1d961ac3bb5928bb1197421644d4facd453639cc74f813c355bdb14665fd34d6", "ja": "……まつりさん？", "zh": "……茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "56685498167c85b21f2fedf8ebd8f5f3d926326ece4672411e82ebc39a9e6acd", "ja": "は……はいほー！", "zh": "Hi……Hi Ho──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "44d6f268716dcb227cc3793df06df6b857a358ffcf5f00fde4a2dd3a0c22e110", "ja": "{$P$}さん、姫におまかせなのです！\nとびきり・わんだほー！な公演にしてみせるのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，交给公主吧！\n公主会打造一场特别美妙的公演的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1013_p", "source_sha256": "26898d53e472d9c03836424ccba93e32c0904f83fbcb95dbb4e5ecd4bee1e7f5", "ja": "おお、気合い充分だな。よろしく頼む！\nそれで、他のメンバーなんだけど……。", "zh": "哦哦，气势十足喔，那就拜托你了！\n然后关于其他成员……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "53e7218aacabbd981867feb3e809f16b29a26983870f6665795b39248d5a89d2", "ja": "{$P$}さんの言いたいこと、\n姫には当然わかっているのですよ。", "zh": "公主当然明白{$P$}先生\n想说什么的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "8953da5dbd88c3ba146b88b6d51aec0bdd6b9134545e7dc0bdb7cae89677cb5e", "ja": "……朋花ちゃん、ロコちゃん！\n姫のステージ、ふたりにも手伝ってほしいのです！", "zh": "……小朋花、小ROCO！\n希望你们也来协助公主的表演唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "5ca526807a7456b290ebab28c92cd83be9eb3bc80d4e6bb67725fed013e1489d", "ja": "うふふ、大きな声を出さなくても聞こえていますよ～。\nもちろん、私もお手伝いさせていただきます～。", "zh": "呵呵，你不用喊这么大声我也听得见～\n当然，我也会一起帮忙的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "d0364543626f55a97b30a81ad4afd1694f4d00fe26295e110ba41f636c5f3334", "ja": "オフコースです♪　マツリのステージにロコのアートが\n加われば、きっとエキサイティングになりますね！", "zh": "Of course♪茉莉的表演加上ROCO的Art，\n一定会变得很Exciting！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "75127bccd17db7e6c0d691c4d060ef43ff49af87a89337163d1f12910d0e2209", "ja": "けど問題は、どうやってマツリのステージに\nロコのアートを組み込むかですね……ふむ……。", "zh": "不过问题在于，要怎么把茉莉的表演跟\nROCO的Art结合在一起……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "88336c6c3b9cccf6ac5b88e6dd2f7894af961efa7610ac4da9770e88111bc98f", "ja": "ふたりとも、ありがとうなのです！\n姫はとっても、うれしいのですー。", "zh": "感谢你们两位的喔！\n公主非常高兴唷──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f65053731774c4b142fdcbb0470c2622c7a7b12de8ae7db4820099bd3dd5cd1f", "ja": "よし、ふたりはOKだな。", "zh": "好，你们两个也OK对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "fb0f91572c19b9e1cd6679b4cbc20248bd94ed69b124eecd4df9713e373c144e", "ja": "ロコちゃんには、姫と一緒に\nステージの演出を考えてもらいましょー！", "zh": "小ROCO就跟公主一起\n规划舞台效果吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "9bdcc08b170142711810ebcba7c32d7669c753d5f6a2f4deeaf25bef3136d7ff", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いいですよね？\n……ね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，这样可以吧？\n……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1023_p", "source_sha256": "25daed41bd0c9bb3c45e32f7be6471f2eab15aef639ab5282b6e5dfbe76d0571", "ja": "ああ、もちろん……\nというか、ロコ？　聞いてるか？", "zh": "嗯，当然可以……\n是说，ROCO？你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "99199e54fb3b35b6b3ea61cbfc2580285c1a5cbcdb9969849ed6378bf0edca9a", "ja": "ブツブツ……はっ！！？　マツリ！　今、\n何かグレートな提案をロコにしませんでしたか！？", "zh": "（自言自语）……啊！！？茉莉！\n你刚刚是不是有给ROCO什么Great的提议！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "3cab5bbe1daa1b22d8873f103c7eceb0cc1846da0315fb7252eb50f352b26673", "ja": "したのです。ロコちゃんに演出をお願いするので、\n姫のステージをより輝かせてください、なのです。", "zh": "有的唷，就是请小ROCO负责规划舞台效果，\n让公主的表演更加光彩夺目吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "0d20f28266e14d654e87b73e0a6d0832c8156253ffb3b1749e21125a50b1c611", "ja": "す、ステージの演出！？　……やります！\nロコが絶対に、エクセレントにしてみせますー！！", "zh": "舞、舞台效果！？ROCO要做！\nROCO绝对会规划得很Excellent！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "e972226e30ce11ce86d1168822dc86f4efdac56c31973664c5de45b350e748f1", "ja": "ロコちゃん、ありがとうなのです。\n姫、とーっても期待しているのですよ？", "zh": "小ROCO，谢谢你唷。\n公主可是很～期待的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "040ac553bbb5f8523b58902c75e8686786011b5a020ff922f1908aa0624ec19c", "ja": "なんだか、素敵なステージになりそうですね～。\n私も、全力を尽くしますよ～♪", "zh": "感觉会成为一场很棒的表演呢～\n我也会全力以赴的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_027_1029_p", "source_sha256": "64d72577a2fdc26cf2f92968a017fad53b1f4f93649daa7e8c1e9fce2c45b8bc", "ja": "（さて、まつりのセンター公演……。\nどんなステージになるか、楽しみになってきたな！）", "zh": "（好了，茉莉的Center公演……\n会成为什么样的表演呢？我开始期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
